#: ../../source/tar-stream_README.md:1
msgid "tar-stream"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/tar-stream_README.md:3
msgid ""
"tar-stream is a streaming tar parser and generator and nothing else. It "
"is streams2 and operates purely using streams which means you can easily "
"extract/parse tarballs without ever hitting the file system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/tar-stream_README.md:5
msgid ""
"Note that you still need to gunzip your data if you have a `.tar.gz`. We "
"recommend using [gunzip-maybe](https://github.com/mafintosh/gunzip-maybe)"
" in conjunction with this."
msgstr ""

